---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Home
description: Recruiting and staffing for students starting out and professionals moving on — plus the employers who hire both.
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

{# ================================================================
   THE CONSOLE — the homepage as one live operations dashboard: a
   bento grid of frosted glass tiles floating over soft blue light,
   not a stack of full-width sections. Replaces the ledger-styled
   hero + card-grid template entirely.
   ================================================================ #}

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-surface to-paper pb-5 pt-14 sm:pt-20">
  <span class="orb -left-40 -top-40 h-[34rem] w-[34rem] bg-brand/20 animate-float" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="orb -right-32 top-24 h-96 w-96 bg-accent/25 animate-float-delayed" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="orb bottom-0 left-1/3 h-80 w-80 bg-brand/10" aria-hidden="true"></span>

  <div class="relative section-container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 lg:grid-cols-12">

      {# ---- Hero tile ---- #}
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-[1.75rem] p-8 sm:p-10 lg:col-span-7 lg:p-12">
        <span class="status-chip bg-accent/15 text-accent">
          <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
            <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-accent opacity-70 motion-reduce:animate-none"></span>
            <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
          </span>
          System status — live
        </span>

        <h1 class="mt-6 font-grotesk text-[2.5rem] font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          Recruiting, running live.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/65">
          Every match, interview, and offer moves through one dashboard — for you to watch, not just wait on.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="{{ '/services/job-placement/' | url }}" class="btn-primary">Find a Job {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-4 h-4") }}</a>
          <a href="{{ '/services/recruitment-staffing/' | url }}" class="btn-outline">Hire Talent</a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-9 flex items-center gap-8 border-t border-border pt-7">
          {% for stat in stats.list.slice(0, 3) %}
          <div>
            <p class="font-mono text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">{{ stat.value }}{{ stat.suffix }}</p>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-ink/50">{{ stat.label }}</p>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      {# ---- Manifest tile ---- #}
      <div class="glass-panel flex flex-col rounded-[1.75rem] lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-6 pt-6">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/50">
            <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
              <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-accent opacity-70 motion-reduce:animate-none"></span>
              <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
            </span>
            Manifest
          </span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink/35">Updated hourly</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3 flex-1 px-6">
          {% for placement in placements.list.slice(0, 4) %}
          <div class="manifest-row">
            <div class="col-span-5 min-w-0">
              <p class="truncate text-sm font-medium text-ink">{{ placement.name }}</p>
              <p class="truncate text-xs text-ink/50">{{ placement.role }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-span-4 min-w-0">
              <p class="truncate font-grotesk text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{{ placement.company }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-span-3 text-right">
              <span class="status-chip {% if placement.status == 'Placed' %}bg-accent/15 text-accent{% else %}bg-brand/10 text-brand{% endif %}">{{ placement.status }}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <p class="px-6 pb-6 pt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink/45">Names shortened at candidates' request.</p>
      </div>

      {# ---- Seekers / Employers / Stats row ---- #}
      <div class="glass-panel relative overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] p-7 card-lift lg:col-span-4">
        <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand text-paper shadow-glow">{{ icon("users", "w-5 h-5") }}</span>
        <h2 class="mt-5 font-grotesk text-xl font-bold text-ink">For Job Seekers</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Personal matching, interview coaching, and offer support — from your first role to your next move.</p>
        <a href="{{ '/services/job-placement/' | url }}" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand transition-all hover:gap-2.5">Explore job placement {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-4 h-4") }}</a>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel relative overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] p-7 card-lift lg:col-span-4">
        <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-accent text-paper shadow-glow-accent">{{ icon("briefcase", "w-5 h-5") }}</span>
        <h2 class="mt-5 font-grotesk text-xl font-bold text-ink">For Employers</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Sourced, screened, and verified candidates — delivered faster than a job board could ever manage.</p>
        <a href="{{ '/services/recruitment-staffing/' | url }}" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-accent transition-all hover:gap-2.5">Explore hiring services {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-4 h-4") }}</a>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel rounded-[1.75rem] p-7 lg:col-span-4">
        <p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/45">Live totals</p>
        <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-5">
          {% for stat in stats.list %}
          <div>
            <p class="font-mono text-2xl font-semibold text-brand" data-count-up data-target="{{ stat.value }}" data-suffix="{{ stat.suffix }}">0{{ stat.suffix }}</p>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-ink/50">{{ stat.label }}</p>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      {# ---- Why us tile ---- #}
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-[1.75rem] p-8 lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why us</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 font-grotesk text-2xl font-bold text-ink">What makes it different</h2>
        <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
          {% set differentiators = [
            { icon: "target", title: "Personalized Matching", text: "A recruiter who's actually read your resume, not a keyword filter.", iconBg: "bg-brand" },
            { icon: "shield", title: "Verified Employers", text: "Every partner company is vetted before you're ever introduced.", iconBg: "bg-accent" },
            { icon: "bolt", title: "Fast Turnaround", text: "Most candidates interview within two to three weeks of onboarding.", iconBg: "bg-ink" },
            { icon: "support", title: "End-to-End Support", text: "We stay involved through the offer, negotiation, and first 90 days.", iconBg: "bg-brand-dark" }
          ] %}
          {% for item in differentiators %}
          <div class="flex gap-3.5">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl {{ item.iconBg }} text-paper">{{ icon(item.icon, "w-4 h-4") }}</span>
            <div class="min-w-0">
              <h3 class="font-grotesk text-sm font-bold text-ink">{{ item.title }}</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/60">{{ item.text }}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      {# ---- Signal (testimonial spotlight) tile ---- #}
      {% set spotlight = testimonials.list[0] %}
      <div class="glass-panel relative flex flex-col rounded-[1.75rem] p-8 lg:col-span-5">
        <span class="status-chip self-start bg-brand/10 text-brand">{{ icon("check-badge", "w-3.5 h-3.5") }} Signal received</span>
        <div class="mt-1 flex items-center gap-1 text-accent">
          {{ icon("star", "w-3.5 h-3.5") }}{{ icon("star", "w-3.5 h-3.5") }}{{ icon("star", "w-3.5 h-3.5") }}{{ icon("star", "w-3.5 h-3.5") }}{{ icon("star", "w-3.5 h-3.5") }}
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 flex-1 font-grotesk text-lg font-medium leading-snug text-ink">&ldquo;{{ spotlight.quote }}&rdquo;</p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-border pt-5">
          {% if spotlight.photo %}
          <img src="{{ spotlight.photo | url }}" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover">
          {% else %}
          <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-paper">{{ spotlight.initials }}</span>
          {% endif %}
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">{{ spotlight.name }}</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink/55">{{ spotlight.role }} · {{ spotlight.company }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {# ---- Services tile (wide) ---- #}
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-[1.75rem] p-8 lg:col-span-12">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">What we do</p>
            <h2 class="mt-2 font-grotesk text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Five services, one pipeline</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-7 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5">
          {% for service in services.list %}
          <a href="{{ service.url | url }}" class="group rounded-2xl border border-white/60 bg-paper/40 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:bg-paper/70">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand/10 text-brand transition-colors group-hover:bg-brand group-hover:text-paper">
              {{ icon(service.icon, "w-5 h-5") }}
            </span>
            <h3 class="mt-4 font-grotesk text-sm font-bold text-ink">{{ service.title }}</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink/60">{{ service.shortDescription }}</p>
            <span class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-brand transition-all group-hover:gap-2">Learn more {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-3.5 h-3.5") }}</span>
          </a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      {# ---- Process tile (wide) ---- #}
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-[1.75rem] p-8 lg:col-span-12">
        <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 font-grotesk text-2xl font-bold text-ink">The process</h2>
        <ol class="mt-7 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
          {% set steps = [
            { label: "Apply", description: "Tell us where you are and where you want to be — takes ten minutes." },
            { label: "Match", description: "We connect you with roles and employers that actually fit the brief." },
            { label: "Interview", description: "Coaching and prep before every conversation that matters." },
            { label: "Placement", description: "An offer, a negotiation assist, and a check-in 90 days in." }
          ] %}
          {% for step in steps %}
          <li class="relative {% if not loop.last %}sm:border-r sm:border-border sm:pr-6{% endif %}">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-paper">
              {{ "0" if loop.index < 10 }}{{ loop.index }}
            </span>
            <h3 class="mt-4 font-grotesk text-base font-bold text-ink">{{ step.label }}</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/60">{{ step.description }}</p>
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- Full-width interlude: the employer network ---------- #}
{% set placedAtLayout = "marquee" %}
{% set placedAtTitle = "Candidates placed in" %}
{% set placedAtLead = "Our people work here now." %}
{% include "partials/placed-at.njk" %}

{# ---------- Signature moment: one trace through the system ---------- #}
<section class="py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="glass-panel rounded-[1.75rem] p-8 sm:p-12">
      <p class="eyebrow">One trace through the system</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 max-w-xl font-grotesk text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">
        Forty applications, no replies. Sixteen days after her first call, an offer.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-ink/65 leading-relaxed">
        Priya's résumé buried a strong analytics background on page two. We rebuilt the profile, matched her to three employers who needed exactly that, and prepped her for every interview.
      </p>

      <div class="relative mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-4">
        <span class="absolute left-[12%] right-[12%] top-4 hidden h-px bg-border sm:block" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {% set trace = [
          { day: "Day 0", label: "Applied", status: "done" },
          { day: "Day 4", label: "Matched", status: "done" },
          { day: "Day 11", label: "Interview", status: "done" },
          { day: "Day 16", label: "Offer", status: "live" }
        ] %}
        {% for point in trace %}
        <div class="relative text-center">
          <span class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full {% if point.status == 'live' %}bg-accent text-ink{% else %}bg-brand text-paper{% endif %} font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold">
            {{ loop.index }}
          </span>
          <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/40">{{ point.day }}</p>
          <p class="mt-0.5 font-grotesk text-sm font-bold text-ink">{{ point.label }}</p>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <blockquote class="mt-10 border-l-4 border-accent pl-5 font-grotesk text-xl font-medium leading-relaxed text-ink">
        &ldquo;The role fit better than anything I'd found on my own.&rdquo;
      </blockquote>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink/55">Priya Nandakumar · Data Analyst, Amazon</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- Closer: bookends the opener ---------- #}
<section class="relative overflow-hidden py-20 sm:py-28">
  <span class="orb -left-24 top-0 h-96 w-96 bg-accent/20" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="orb -right-24 bottom-0 h-96 w-96 bg-brand/15" aria-hidden="true"></span>

  <div class="section-container relative">
    <div class="glass-panel rounded-[1.75rem] p-10 text-center sm:p-16">
      <span class="status-chip mx-auto w-fit bg-accent/15 text-accent">
        <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
          <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-accent opacity-70 motion-reduce:animate-none"></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
        </span>
        Ready when you are
      </span>
      <h2 class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl font-grotesk text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">
        Ready to find your footing?
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/65">
        Whether you're job hunting or hiring, the first conversation is free.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}" class="btn-primary">Get Started {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-4 h-4") }}</a>
        <a href="{{ site.phoneHref }}" class="btn-outline">{{ icon("phone", "w-4 h-4") }} {{ site.phone }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/variant-switcher.njk" %}
